  sequenceName: Ch6_Choice_Utilities
  lines:
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: The lights stay on and the water runs warm, but the school notice about
      unpaid fees stays pinned to the door.
  - speakerName: Lucille
    text: We need light to do homework by. I'll explain to the school. Again.
